{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b7ae56ae-98b1-8f86-9207-d1619a01d107",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T11:42:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rafael Quintero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:39:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. Um, I think I'm in the right place? I got a quote from a fence company, you know, and before I sign anything I wanted to check a couple things."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:39:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, you're in the right place. What are you putting up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:39:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Vinyl. Four feet tall, so, I mean, not a big tall privacy thing. Just around the back yard. Right? Four feet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:39:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, vinyl, four feet. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:39:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, do I need to pull a permit before the guy starts? Because the company said they could just start, like, next week, and I wasn't sure if that's, you know, how it works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:39:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally a fence does need a permit here, yes. I wouldn't let them put a post in the ground until that's sorted out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:39:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. But, so, the company, do they do that or do I do that? I mean, I thought maybe it's only for the tall ones. Like six feet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:40:08-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Height matters for some of the rules, but it's not that only tall ones need a permit. As for who files, plenty of contractors will handle it, but ask them straight out and get it in writing in the quote. The permit's tied to your property, so you want to know it's done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:40:25-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Okay, so ask them if the permit's included. Got it. And then, um, the other thing, how close to the property line can it go? Like, can it sit right on the line? Or does it have to be, I don't know, back a foot or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:40:41-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There are setback and placement rules, and they can depend on your lot and the zone. I don't want to give you a number off the top of my head that's wrong for your yard. When you apply, you'll show a plan with where the fence sits, and we review it then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:40:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I need a plan. Like a drawing? I mean, I have the survey thing from when we bought the house, is that, is that what you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:41:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good start. A copy of your survey with the fence line drawn on it is what most people bring. The fence company usually knows how to mark it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:41:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Okay, that, yeah, that I can do. Sorry, I'm just, I'm kind of new at all this. I'm more of a, I'm learning ukulele from videos, so, you know, this is a different kind of confusing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:41:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the fence paperwork's a bit easier than chords, I hope. Do you want me to transfer you to the permit desk so they can tell you what to submit and how it's reviewed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:41:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Wait, so just to make sure I have it, permit first, before they start, and they either do it or I do it, and the line thing they'll tell me. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:41:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Permit first, ask the company if they file it, and the setback gets sorted when you apply. Hold on, I'll send you over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:42:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thanks a lot. I'll hold."
    }
  ],
